                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px;">Win 3x to 6x Instantly! Results every hour.</p>
                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b2b3c, #161622); border: 2px dashed var(--primary); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <h2 style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px;">RICH EMPIRE</h2>
                    <div id="ticketNum" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 4px; background: #000; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 5px; color: var(--accent); display: inline-block;">RE-XXXXX</div>
