            <div class="card text-center" style="border-color: #00e5ff;">
                <h3>VIP Level 2</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0;">₹3000 • 2 Days Access • 2 Withdraws/Day • 5% Cash Back</p>
